NOTE=' English and Pashto are our translations (need native review); watermark, handwriting, page-edge shadows, a thumb at the page edge and ornamental borders excluded. Scan n = printed page n+1 up to scan 126; scans 127 and 128 are duplicates of scans 125 and 126 (the mapping to files then changes).'
def fin(s,note):
    s['sourceNote']=note+NOTE; s['vocabulary']={}; save(s)
